      "description": "Hardknott Fort Entrance &amp; Pass This break in the walls around Hardknott Castle Roman Fort is the southeastern gateway and leads via a path to the 546609. Beyond, wiggling up the hillside, can be seen the Hardknott Pass - being one of England's more interesting roads it is driven mostly for fun rather than for access to anywhere !",
